  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The novel treats rule path as a named cultivation path with Immortal Gu, killer moves, and ranked attainment, not as a metaphor for law.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Amplify effect Gu is from the rule path. It supplements other Gu worms and amplifies the chosen Gu worm’s effects. The amplification level depends on the amplify effect Gu’s rank: higher rank means greater effect, with higher primeval essence expenditure as the drawback. Fire path and water path Gu Masters can use it, and Fang Yuan notes that both his enslavement and strength paths can use amplify effect Gu. Among Hei tribe resources he finds over a dozen amplify effect Gu and picks the rank five piece, which boosts a Gu worm’s effectiveness by five times.",
      "chapters": [
        522
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "what-the-path-governs",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_amplify_effect_gu",
        "sys_gu_worms",
        "path_fire",
        "fac_gu_masters",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "fac_hei_tribe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In the fight around Miniscule Mountain, a miniman race Gu Immortal is a rule path Gu Immortal who holds the rule path Immortal Gu Small and uses the immortal killer move big to small, shrinking incoming killer moves until they are easy to block. Unfettered Scholar is also a rule path Gu Immortal. He holds the rule path Immortal Gu Disintegrate and the immortal killer move thousand disintegrations. The narration states that to counter rule path with rule path is the most effective option. When thousand disintegrations meets big to small, the miniman Gu Immortal answers that Unfettered Scholar’s rule path Immortal Gu is only rank six while Small Gu is rank seven.",
      "chapters": [
        801
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "small-and-disintegrate",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_miniscule_mountain",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_unfettered_scholar",
        "race_minimen"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Tu Shi Cheng places Limitless Demon Venerable as the creator of rule path in the Olden Antiquity Era.",
      "chapters": [
        1323
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "limitless-founding",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_tu_shi_cheng",
        "char_limitless_demon_venerable",
        "evt_era_olden"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After exhausting dream realms, Fang Yuan’s listed attainments include rule path at great grandmaster, alongside theft path, transformation path, qi path, fire path, wisdom path, water path, earth path, and poison path.",
      "chapters": [
        2154
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fang-yuan-attainment",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "A later stretch still names him a great grandmaster in rule path among that same cluster of paths.",
      "chapters": [
        2180
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fang-yuan-attainment",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Still later, his transformation path and rule path attainment levels rise again while he works with heaven path immortal materials.",
